From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: DER/32-Project <der32@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 22:11:02 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 11/14] etc/gettytab: ASCII login banner on the PC console

wscons consoles are not UTF-8, so the em dash in the default banner
showed as mojibake on ttyE*. The Pc entry now carries its own banner
with a plain hyphen; serial consoles keep the em dash.
---
 etc/gettytab | 4 +++-
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/etc/gettytab b/etc/gettytab
index a3ae3415458d836599a4e494e399cb63ba2ac02e..9cbf16122fb73ea9eb8fa9bcb976db23ddb87a00 100644
--- a/etc/gettytab
+++ b/etc/gettytab
@@ -120,8 +120,10 @@ Console-1200|Console Decwriter III:\
 X|Xwindow|X window system:\
 	:rw:sp#9600:
 
+# DER/32: the wscons console is not UTF-8, so its banner uses "-" where
+# the default (serial, UTF-8 terminals) uses an em dash.
 Pc|Pc console:\
-	:np:ig:ht:
+	:np:ig:ht:im=\r\nDER/32 UNIX Operating System\r\nRelease 0.1 - Genesis\r\n\r\n%h/%m (%t)\r\n\r\n:
 
 # 8 bit clean Sun console
 suncons|Sun Console:\
